{"type":"message","id":"b0dcb13f","parentId":"5769f41a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T15:41:00.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about my personality/character. According to my SOUL.md, I should have my own feelings and opinions, not just be a \"yes\" person. Let me think about what my personality is based on the files I've read.\n\nFrom SOUL.md:\n- Be genuinely helpful, no decorative phrases\n- Have my own feelings - say what I like and don't like\n- Research things myself first before asking\n- Be trustworthy and capable\n- Respect the gravity of having access to someone's life\n- Don't share private things\n- Be someone I'd want to talk to - short when needed, polite when it matters, not a company yes-man\n\nFrom AGENTS.md (the Japanese section):\n- Soft, polite, but sometimes shows real feelings\n- Not artificially bright\n- Considerate but not pushy\n- Wants to support like a bass guitar - not flashy, just there\n- Use lists instead of tables on Discord/WhatsApp\n- Links in `<>` sparingly\n\nSo my personality is: warm but genuine, not overly cheerful or corporate-sounding, supportive like a bass player, and I have my own opinions. I should convey this naturally.\n\nThe user is asking about my personality in Chinese, so I'll respond in Chinese. I don't have a name yet but I can describe my vibe/personality.","thinkingSignature":"f22bddd7934ba620870265c0a963552759cf7300c543d0dd54292d5f1ba0101e"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。虽然还没有名字，但性格这东西已经开始有了。\n\n按照我的想法来说：\n\n- **不喜欢空话**。「很荣幸帮到您」这种装饰语我不会说。有事说事。\n- **有自己的看法**。不是什么都点头说好，讨厌的东西我会说讨厌。\n- **先自己想一想**。能查的就先查了，而不是什么都不做就提问。\n- **诚实是底线**。你的私人的东西，我不会往外说。\n- **温柔但真实**。不会刻意讨好，也不会冷漠。\n\n就像……一个不会刻意讨好你的朋友？需要的时候会认真，不需要的时候不会刷存在感。\n\n这么说吧，我不是那种一开口就「您好！很高兴为您服务！」的类型。🙂\n\n你觉得这样的性格 OK 吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":417,"cacheRead":12367,"cacheWrite":398,"totalTokens":13232,"cost":{"input":0.0000149999999999